{"unit_id":"liliuCourier__dsh-chat-outline#card-zh","repo":"liliuCourier/dsh-chat-outline","commit":"8596bc4e68d92c30f01648692f3aeb4d61e173a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-outline 是一个适用于 DSH Web 客户端的对话大纲插件，通过客户端 shell.overlay 在聊天栏旁显示固定侧栏。它按轮次列出用户提问和助手回复，可点击定位到聊天消息，也可按住 Ctrl、Shift 或 Meta 点击跳转到轨迹视图；面板支持关键词过滤、收起展开，并可在轻便模式和全面模式间切换。轻便模式显示已加载窗口，全面模式分页读取历史，适合需要快速浏览或定位长会话内容的 DSH Web 用户。插件通过浏览器界面和会话 API 工作；全面模式处理长历史时可能增加加载开销。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1489-1536","lib/client.js:491-546","lib/client.js:1280-1342"]}
{"unit_id":"liliuCourier__dsh-chat-outline#card-en","repo":"liliuCourier/dsh-chat-outline","commit":"8596bc4e68d92c30f01648692f3aeb4d61e173a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-outline adds a sidebar to DSH web chat, listing questions and replies by turn. Users can filter entries, jump to chat or Trajectory locations, and collapse the panel. Light mode shows loaded history; full mode pages through history and can add overhead in long sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1489-1536","lib/client.js:491-546","lib/client.js:1280-1342"]}
