{"unit_id":"liliuCourier__dsh-chat-outline#feature-1","repo":"liliuCourier/dsh-chat-outline","commit":"8596bc4e68d92c30f01648692f3aeb4d61e173a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-outline 的功能「按轮次查看对话」：侧栏将用户提问与该轮助手回复列成可浏览的条目。点击提问或回复行，会在聊天视图定位到相应消息；目标较早时会继续加载历史页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:254-294","lib/client.js:491-546","lib/client.js:1406-1484"]}
